koz Benchmark : strings. 48 000 concatenations, every result is interned finkoz

zafer batis(n, s)
ouver
    kan n piti 1 ouver ran s fèrm
    ran batis(n mwin 1, s èk "ab")
fèrm

zafer repete(k)
ouver
    kan k piti 1 ouver ran 0 fèrm
    batis(60, "")
    ran repete(k mwin 1)
fèrm

afise(batis(5, ">"))
afise(repete(800))
